<table class="tbl"><tr><th>COMMODITY</th><th>PRICE</th><th>HOLD</th><th></th></tr><%~ it.length2Market %></table><div class="tradefoot"><span class="dim small">Estimates include cargo grade, your perks and the size of the order. There is no separate trading fee. Prices can change before you click; a price here does not promise the same price elsewhere. Green is cheap here, red is high. Hold: <%~ it.playerPayloadCargoUsed %> / <%~ it.computedShipStats %> t<%~ it.playerPayloadJobCargo %>.</span><%~ it.holdFree %><%~ it.length2MarketSome %></div>